### Database Setup

In the `pom.xml` and `application.yaml` we provide configuration needed for {{server}} database.
Start your database before running this example.

The generated tests start and stop a separate MySQL database using Testcontainers.
A Docker-compatible container runtime is required to run them, including when
the application is configured for Oracle DB or MongoDB. These tests are skipped
when Docker is unavailable.

